                "description": "Updatable fields include name, email, dob, gender, address*, city/state/country, primaryHealthConcern, fcm_id, password/newPassword, profileImage. Do not send `status`. WhatsApp number changes to a different value must use the OTP endpoints."
              },
              "response": []
